              ]
            },
            "title": "Synthesis"
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospital admission of your 23-year-old male patient, admitted on 14/07/2020 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection. On admission, he presented with fever, dry cough, and progressive dyspnoea. Chest X-ray and CT thorax confirmed bilateral pneumonic infiltrates consistent with COVID-19 pneumonia. Blood tests, arterial blood gases, and continuous pulse oximetry were performed to monitor respiratory status. The patient required supplemental oxygen therapy and was treated with dexamethasone and anticoagulation. Remdesivir was administered per current protocol. Supportive intravenous fluids were given. Respiratory physiotherapy was initiated during recovery. The patient improved steadily and was discharged on 26/07/2020 in a recovering condition. Please arrange follow-up including repeat chest imaging in 6 weeks. Do not hesitate to contact me for further information.</div>"
            },
